### TEMPORARY — the ADRs are written in Russian and this repository's docs are English.
### They stay local until they are translated; delete this line when they are, and they
### become normal tracked documentation. Nothing else needs to change: the practice is
### already wired in (systems-analyst drafts one per architectural fork, feature-pipeline
### Phase 7 flips it to Accepted), and CLAUDE.md already points readers at the directory.
